	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Net navigator panel: missing sheets after adding a local label\n- enable Net Navigator panel\n- switch to sheet 2 (\"Spannungsversgung\")\n- highlight net \"+12V\"\n- net navigator panel shows occurence on 5 subsheets\n- switch to sheet 7 (\"Schnittstellen\")\n- connect the existing local label to the +12V-net\n- observe net navigator panel: suddenly only 2 subsheets are shown\n- dehighlighting + again highlighting doesn't helps\n- only save + restart eeschema shows again the complete content on the net navigator panel"
